Art: assets/ and docs/media/
  Commander portraits, unit sprites, weapons, rig part sheets, structures and
  backdrops were generated with OpenAI's gpt-image-2 image model from the prompts
  in tools/gen-*.mjs, on a flat #00FF00 background. They were then keyed and
  cropped (tools/cut-chroma.py), sliced into rig parts with pivots and mounts
  (tools/slice-parts.py, tools/slice-siege.py, tools/slice-creature.py) and
  converted to WebP (tools/webp.py). docs/media/ holds screenshots of the game
  recorded with tools/record-demo.mjs.

